- 13,791.43584 × 1.40 = 19,308.010176

If you rounded to the cent after each step, you would get 10,914.40 → 12,769.85 → 13,791.44 → 19,308.02. That is one cent higher, so rounding only at the end matters here. I'm sure of the arithmetic. The only open point is which rounding convention you intended, and your question says "rounded to the cent" for the final price only.

